---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Factory Reset Detail"
  description="Privacy policy for Factory Reset Detail."
  noindex={true}
  canonicalOverride="https://factoryresetdetail.com/privacy"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-24 text-neutral-300">
    <h1 class="mb-8 font-['Cormorant_Garamond'] text-4xl font-semibold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-neutral-500">Effective date: June 4, 2026</p>

    <p class="mb-8">
      Factory Reset Detail ("we," "us," or "our") operates the website
      <span class="text-white">factoryresetdetail.com</span>. This policy explains what information we
      collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      When you request a quote or book a service, we collect information you provide directly —
      including your name, email address, phone number, vehicle details, and service address. We also
      receive photos you submit for pre-inspection purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Assistant Integration</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      Our booking flow uses Cal.com, a third-party scheduling platform. When you book an
      appointment, your name, email, and scheduling preferences are processed by Cal.com under their
      own privacy policy. We receive confirmation details from that platform to fulfill your service.
      No AI assistant or automated decision-making is used to determine pricing, eligibility, or
      service outcomes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Analytics and Advertising</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      We use Google Analytics (GA4) and Google Ads to understand site traffic and measure the
      effectiveness of our advertising. These services may set cookies and collect anonymized usage
      data. You can opt out via your browser settings or Google's opt-out tools.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Photo Submissions</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      Photos submitted through our pre-inspection form are used solely to assess your vehicle's
      condition before your appointment. We do not share these photos with third parties beyond what
      is necessary to prepare for your service.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Data Retention</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      We retain booking and contact information for as long as necessary to provide our services and
      comply with applicable law. You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">
      You have the right to access, correct, or delete personal information we hold about you. To
      exercise these rights or ask questions about this policy, contact us at:
    </p>

    <p class="mb-8">
      <a
        href="mailto:aczeugin@gmail.com"
        class="text-white underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-300"
      >aczeugin@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy periodically. The effective date above reflects the most recent
      revision. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
